title: "MFFT: Multi-Frequency Fusion Transformer for Explainable AI-Generated Image Detection"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-13"
license: "MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MIHMahmudEli/mfft"
url: "https://imageverify-ai.vercel.app"
keywords:
  - "ai-generated-image-detection"
  - "deepfake-detection"
  - "image-forensics"
  - "frequency-analysis"
  - "fourier-transform"
  - "vision-transformer"
  - "cross-attention"
  - "frequency-guided-attention"
  - "reproducible-research"
abstract: >-
  Official implementation, pretrained weights, and inference pipelines for the
  Multi-Frequency Fusion Transformer (MFFT), a parameter-efficient vision architecture
  for detecting AI-generated imagery and deepfakes across radial Fourier frequency sub-bands
  using depthwise separable convolutions and Frequency-Guided Cross-Attention (FGA).
